    gameplay: 'Players contribute forced bets (ante or blinds), receive five down cards, complete first betting, perform a single draw (discard 0-5 then draw equal replacements, or stand pat), complete final betting, and go to showdown.',
    keyRules: [
      'Aces are always low.',
      'Straights and flushes count and are bad for low ranking.',
      'Best hand is 6-4-3-2-A (not a flush).',
      'A-2-3-4-5 is a straight and therefore weak in this variant.',
      'Hands are compared from highest card downward among low hands.',
